    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                "word": "unreality",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "dafdcff7-5b94-4d3f-a7ac-0a93a8ee4adf",
                        "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "unrealities"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e97164b7-b461-3bcf-bf14-996bb94bfcfb",
                        "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lack of reality or real existence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a9e9eca-3cfd-3c02-ae5d-f95951632d80",
                        "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The state of being unreal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a7829b2-55b2-4243-8df1-a6ddd263903d",
                                "sense_id": "7a9e9eca-3cfd-3c02-ae5d-f95951632d80",
                                "text": "Thus it was that I beheld, as never before, the awful unreality called evil. The equipollence of God brought to light another glorious proposition, — man’s perfectibility and the establishment of the kingdom of heaven on earth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4674ff7-a4ac-433c-93b3-df48d77932ec",
                                "sense_id": "7a9e9eca-3cfd-3c02-ae5d-f95951632d80",
                                "text": "Then, the Lord, for the sake of those involved in the Universal Vehicle, turned a second wheel of Dharma, even more wondrous and amazing, by proclaiming emptiness, starting from the fact of the unreality, productionlessness, ceaselessness, primordial peace, and natural liberation of all things."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74d74f79-9ef3-3750-b010-3becf1bc71ee",
                        "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That which has no reality or real existence; something unreal or imaginary"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "117a9eec-c6b0-3e16-ad44-86cb27ef6715",
                        "entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unpractical character; visionariness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90d36d6f-808e-4557-bfa3-ebff1aedbd77",
                        "source_entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Translations",
                        "target_lang_word": "irréalité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irréalité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ca093aa-8a9b-30ae-a72e-eff77c15ed79",
                                        "entry_id": "e62ba658-0426-34d7-9bf3-dc06a00011fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualité de ce qui n’est pas réel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29305c5c-3a82-44a8-ae5c-24f5deeb6a63",
                                                "sense_id": "6ca093aa-8a9b-30ae-a72e-eff77c15ed79",
                                                "text": "Le subjonctif est employé pour souligner une incertitude ou une irréalité, là où l'indicatif dénoterait d'une certitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1fecbae-5bfd-4686-8548-4ace3fd52c05",
                                                "sense_id": "6ca093aa-8a9b-30ae-a72e-eff77c15ed79",
                                                "text": "L’irréalité des mathématiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f17daad9-8147-321d-83bb-66db25024a78",
                                        "entry_id": "e62ba658-0426-34d7-9bf3-dc06a00011fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nature de ce qui parait irréel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "hyperbole"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8d9e375-1022-4a08-ba79-5e8abc65f8fa",
                                                "sense_id": "f17daad9-8147-321d-83bb-66db25024a78",
                                                "text": "A voir revenir sous la lumière jaune et sale de la cabine ces contours qui m’étaient si familiers, j’éprouvais un sentiment d’irréalité, si étrange il me paraissait que ces symboles armés, que j’avais si longtemps interrogés au fond de leur châsse souterraine, fussent là maintenant déployés pour servir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3930fcd9-05ce-418e-b3b5-99dcaea8a1c3",
                                                "sense_id": "f17daad9-8147-321d-83bb-66db25024a78",
                                                "text": "Quant aux « désespoir du peintre », la finesse des petites taches rouges sur le blanc des pétales m'attirait sans que jamais j'aie pu savoir pourquoi leur irréalité me troublait autant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "37b9a25c-622f-4b7f-b283-dff998f96839",
                        "source_entry_id": "76b79654-6018-3a62-8741-7d74212fb42d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Translations",
                        "target_lang_word": "irrealtà",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
